## 1. Both fence characters

Before the fences, §FS-002-target.1 is ordinary prose.

```markdown
[§FS-002-target.1](FS-002-target.md#1-detail)
[§FS-<foo>.3.1](<relative-path>#<anchor>)
```

Between the fences, §FS-002-target.1 is ordinary prose.

~~~markdown
[§FS-002-target.1](FS-002-target.md#1-detail)
[§FS-<foo>.3.1](<relative-path>#<anchor>)
~~~

After the fences, §FS-002-target.1 is ordinary prose.
